{
  "summary": "网页正文从AI算法层面明确区分了强化学习的两条正交技术路线：模型无关vs模型基（显式动力学模型）和on-policy vs off-policy（训练数据来源）。指出这两条轴常被混淆，但实际独立，并给出了每种组合的典型算法族（如PPO、DQN、Dreamer、MBPO）及核心审计问题。强调了模型误差在规划中的累积效应以及off-policy带来的分布偏移问题。",
  "key_excerpts": [
    "Two orthogonal axes cut through the confusion: whether the algorithm builds an explicit model of environment dynamics, and whether its training data came from the very policy it is trying to improve.",
    "Model-free and model-based describe what the algorithm represents. On-policy and off-policy describe where the training data came from.",
    "A model-based algorithm can generate imagined rollouts entirely under the current policy, keeping it on-policy by data provenance.",
    "An on-policy method updates a target policy using data generated by that same policy. An off-policy method learns about a target policy π from data generated by a behavior policy μ.",
    "Model error compounds across planning horizons regardless of whether the data policy matches the target policy. Occupancy mismatch corrupts gradient estimates regardless of whether a dynamics model is present."
  ]
}

